    "title": "Biblia con lenguaje actual",
    "description": "Bible with current language: with this free and intuitive app, we offer you a new and surprising way to learn the Holy Bible. You can have the full text of the Bible on your phone. Download the best application to read, study and listen to the Holy Word on your Android smartphone or tablet.\r\nTo be a good Christian, it is essential to dedicate a few minutes of your life to reading the Bible, the word of God. We make it easy for you: download for free this great Bible app with amazing new features:\r\n\r\nFEATURES OF THE APP\r\n\r\n- The Bible with current language is free and free: you pay nothing and you get the full text of the Bible\r\n- Easy and friendly user interface and design\r\n- Offline: you do not need an internet connection to use it\r\n- High quality audio to listen to the verses while you read\r\n\r\nMORE FEATURES:\r\n\r\n- You can underline, highlight and copy verses to make a list of favorites\r\n- Add notes or add dates to your saved verses\r\n- Search by keywords within the Bible\r\n- Change the font size of the text to suit your needs\r\n- Set night or day mode to rest your eyes when you read at night\r\n\r\nEXTRA FUNCTIONALITIES\r\n- The app reminds you where you stopped reading when you resume reading\r\n- If you wish, you can receive the verse of the day on your phone. They are inspiring messages to start your day. You can schedule it daily or weekly.\r\n- Through the app, you can create beautiful images with biblical messages to send and share\r\n- You can send verses by email, WhatsApp or SMS or easily share them on Facebook, Twitter or Instagram.\r\n- All features are free\r\n\r\nTHE COMPLETE BIBLE ON YOUR PHONE\r\nThis is the complete list of the books of the Old and New Testament that you can read in your new Bible app with current language\r\n\r\nOld Testament: (Genesis, Exodus, Leviticus, Numbers, Deuteronomy, Joshua, Judges, Ruth, 1 Samuel, 2 Samuel, 1 Kings, 2 Kings, 1 Chronicles, 2 Chronicles, Ezra, Nehemiah, Esther, Job, Psalms, Proverbs, Ecclesiastes, Song of Solomon, Isaiah, Jeremiah, Lamentations, Ezekiel, Daniel, Hosea, Joel, Amos, Obadiah, Jonah, Micah, Nahum, Habakkuk, Zephaniah, Haggai, Zechariah, Malachi)\r\n\r\nNew Testament: (Matthew, Mark, Luke, John, Acts, Romans, 1 Corinthians, 2 Corinthians, Galatians, Ephesians, Philippians, Colossians, 1 Thessalonians, 2 Thessalonians, 1 Timothy, 2 Timothy, Titus, Philemon, Hebrews, James, 1 Peter, 2 Peter, 1 John, 2 John, 3 John, Jude, Revelation)",
    "descriptionHTML": "Bible with current language: with this free and intuitive app, we offer you a new and surprising way to learn the Holy Bible. You can have the full text of the Bible on your phone. Download the best application to read, study and listen to the Holy Word on your Android smartphone or tablet.<br>To be a good Christian, it is essential to dedicate a few minutes of your life to reading the Bible, the word of God. We make it easy for you: download for free this great Bible app with amazing new features:<br><br>FEATURES OF THE APP<br><br>- The Bible with current language is free and free: you pay nothing and you get the full text of the Bible<br>- Easy and friendly user interface and design<br>- Offline: you do not need an internet connection to use it<br>- High quality audio to listen to the verses while you read<br><br>MORE FEATURES:<br><br>- You can underline, highlight and copy verses to make a list of favorites<br>- Add notes or add dates to your saved verses<br>- Search by keywords within the Bible<br>- Change the font size of the text to suit your needs<br>- Set night or day mode to rest your eyes when you read at night<br><br>EXTRA FUNCTIONALITIES<br>- The app reminds you where you stopped reading when you resume reading<br>- If you wish, you can receive the verse of the day on your phone. They are inspiring messages to start your day. You can schedule it daily or weekly.<br>- Through the app, you can create beautiful images with biblical messages to send and share<br>- You can send verses by email, WhatsApp or SMS or easily share them on Facebook, Twitter or Instagram.<br>- All features are free<br><br>THE COMPLETE BIBLE ON YOUR PHONE<br>This is the complete list of the books of the Old and New Testament that you can read in your new Bible app with current language<br><br>Old Testament: (Genesis, Exodus, Leviticus, Numbers, Deuteronomy, Joshua, Judges, Ruth, 1 Samuel, 2 Samuel, 1 Kings, 2 Kings, 1 Chronicles, 2 Chronicles, Ezra, Nehemiah, 